OL,3,AWhat we now know about the UK economy
OL,4,Ain four charts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK may have no involvement in the
OL,7,FUS-Iran war, but the country is feeling
OL,8,Fthe full force of the conflict on its
OL,9,Feconomy.
OL,11,FSoaring energy prices are set to dent
OL,12,Fgrowth in the short term, push up
OL,13,Finflation and leave living standards in
OL,14,Fa "grim" place, according to the latest
OL,15,Fofficial forecast from the Office for
OL,16,FBudget Responsibility (OBR).
OL,18,FInterest rates are also predicted to
OL,19,Frise, making borrowing more expensive,
OL,20,Falong with government debt repayments.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
